es_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot 4.4.1 stable\n\n### System information\n\nLinux Mint\n\n### Issue description\n\nI need SpringBoneSimulator3D to simulate a balloon like component in my game.\n\nThis component can be affected by different wind speed, I want to use the set_gravity and set_gravity_direction function to be able to emulate change in wind forces.\n\nMy issue, is that everytime I try to set these value, the SpringBoneSimulator3D simulation reset.\n\nThis is very limiting and prevents me to make a reactive effect.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a1809682-5c4a-4270-8259-6ae47c381e7b\n\nMake a SpringBoneSimulator3D chain with a few bones and try to change the gravity, gravity direction or stiffness property in run time.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[MRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23551273/MRP.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112767/react